    {
      "id": "claim_d459185a7f0040758d553d66a543d70b",
      "statement": "openwiki_begin returns either an ActiveBeginView (a planning/generating run carrying a fresh runId) or a NoopBeginView; the host must check status and stop on noop. A no-op is produced only for update mode when force is not set, the update preflight reports the repository unchanged, and the Claims preflight reports zero issues.",
