    {
      "id": "claim_8ac19bd8911548e487d8d88635e39f3f",
      "statement": "openwiki_submit_page requires the current pending job's jobId and the page's complete intended Claim set; it requires the page Markdown to be written with valid front matter before accepting Claims, then durably persists and verifies the page's Claims (page version, verification event, and full Claim set must match the bytes) before marking the job complete and advancing the queue. Re-submitting an already-complete job is idempotent and only the current pending job may be submitted.",
      "evidence": [
