      "statement": "If a lifecycle call reports source drift, the host must call openwiki_begin again and submit a replacement plan; it must never reuse the invalidated plan. Drift is detected on resume (invalidating the persisted plan and resetting to planning) and during finish via requireStableSourceFingerprint, which persists the new fingerprint and throws a conflict error.",
